      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-[16px]">Our track record reflects years of hard work and dedication to our clients' recovery.</p>
      <a href="#free-consultation" class="inline-block mt-6 bg-primary text-primary-foreground border border-primary px-5 py-3 rounded-[4px] font-medium text-[16px] hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors">Schedule a Free Case Evaluation</a>
